  "notable_quotes": [
    "Stepwise crystallization of Zn/H3btc/Htrz under hydrothermal conditions yielded three distinct products: 1 as a 3-D microporous framework, 2 as a 3-D pillared-layer MOF, and 3 as a 1-D chain.",
    "Complex 1 can be described by 8-connected (Zn1)(Zn3)2(trz)4(COO)2 SBUs that assemble into a trinodal 3,8-connected 3-D network.",
    "Complex 3 is not a 3-D coordination framework; it is a neutral 1-D [Zn(Hbtc)]n chain with Zn...Zn distance 10.189 A, extended to higher dimensions only by H-bonding and water clusters."
  ],
